// Issue #150: console commands whose output must be the same before and after the change.
// Run with: -con <this file>. The markers help to cut the log.
printf ===BEGIN-150
printf ===cmdline
cmdline
printf ===commandlineparams
commandlineparams
printf ===commandlineparams-mask
commandlineparams -n*
commandlineparams -con
printf ===cmdlist
cmdlist
printf ===typeof
typeof mirror_stdout
typeof screenshotformat
printf ===END-150
